{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"历代志上","commonName":"历代志上","title":"历代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"fc4564236e3ad71076ed44b678c67d6581a3c5d084477a871eeffdf3670ae182","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["众人把上帝的约柜抬进去，安放在大卫所搭的帐幕里，然后在上帝面前献上燔祭和平安祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大卫献上燔祭和平安祭后，就奉耶和华的名给民众祝福，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["又给所有以色列人，不论男女，每人一个饼、一块肉和一个葡萄饼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["大卫指派一些利未人在耶和华的约柜前事奉，颂扬、称谢和赞美以色列的上帝耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["为首的是亚萨，其次是撒迦利雅、雅薛、示米拉末、耶歇、玛他提雅、以利押、比拿雅、俄别·以东和耶利，他们鼓瑟弹琴，亚萨敲钹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["比拿雅和雅哈悉两位祭司在上帝的约柜前吹号。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["大卫的颂歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["那一天，大卫初次指派亚萨和他的亲族唱诗歌颂耶和华，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“你们要称谢耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呼求祂的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在列邦传扬祂的作为。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要歌颂、赞美祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"述说祂一切奇妙的作为。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要以祂的圣名为荣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿寻求耶和华的人心中快乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要寻求耶和华和祂的能力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"时常来到祂面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂仆人以色列的后裔啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂所拣选的雅各的子孙啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要记住祂所行的神迹奇事和祂口中的判词。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“祂是我们的上帝耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂在普天下施行审判。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要永远铭记祂的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"历经千代也不可忘记祂的应许，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是祂与亚伯拉罕所立的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向以撒所起的誓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂将这约定为律例赐给雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定为永远的约赐给以色列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂说，‘我必把迦南赐给你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作为你的产业。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"“那时他们人丁稀少，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寥寥可数，在当地寄居，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在异国他乡流离飘零。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华不容人压迫他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"还为他们的缘故责备君王，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说，‘不可加害我膏立的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不可伤害我的先知。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"“普世都要歌颂耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天天传扬祂的救恩；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在列国述说祂的荣耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在万民中述说祂的奇妙作为。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华无比伟大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当受至高的颂扬；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂超越一切神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当受敬畏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦的神明都是假的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯独耶和华创造了诸天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂带着尊贵和威严，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的圣所充满能力和喜乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"“万族万民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要把荣耀和能力归给耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"归给耶和华！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要将耶和华之名当得的荣耀归给祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要将供物献给祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要穿圣衣敬拜耶和华","poem":1},{"noteId":9},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地要在祂面前颤抖；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世界坚立不摇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿天欢喜，愿地快乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他们在列国宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘耶和华执掌王权！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿海洋和其中的万物都欢呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿田野和其中的一切都欢腾！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，林中的树木都要在耶和华面前欢唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂要来审判天下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要称谢耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂是美善的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的慈爱永远长存！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"text":"“要说，‘拯救我们的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你拯救我们，招聚我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我们从列国中救出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们好称谢你的圣名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以赞美你为荣。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的上帝耶和华永永远远当受称颂！”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众民都说：“阿们！”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并赞美耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["分派事奉的人员"]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":["大卫派亚萨及其亲族天天在约柜前事奉耶和华，尽当尽的职分；"]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":["又派俄别·以东及其六十八位亲族、何萨和耶杜顿的儿子俄别·以东守门；"]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":["并派祭司撒督及其他祭司在基遍丘坛的耶和华的圣幕前供职，"]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":["按照耶和华在律法书上对以色列人的吩咐，每日早晚在祭坛上献燔祭给耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":["与他们一同供职的有希幔、耶杜顿和其他人，他们被特别选出来称谢上帝，因为祂的慈爱永远长存。"]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":["希幔和耶杜顿负责用号、钹及其他乐器伴奏歌颂上帝。耶杜顿的子孙负责守门。"]},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":["于是，众民各自回家，大卫也回去为家人祝福。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"或译“要敬拜圣洁荣耀的耶和华”。","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":29}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":42}